Learn foreign languages with SubTune! People learn foreign languages in different ways – with tutors, in language courses and schools, through books, apps, websites. However, many people forget that the most effective way is to immerse yourself in the language environment and learn the language in context (and ideally from native speakers).
Fortunately, this can be easily done, as articles, news, videos, and movies in the original are available to everyone via the Internet. The only problem – understanding an unfamiliar words – can be also easily solved. That`s what the Subtune: Listening Podcast!

MAIN FEATURES:

– Instan translate words and phrases;
– Video slowdown by clicking on the subtitles;
– Repeating a video by clicking on the subtitles;
– Ability to select and copy words for study;
– Context learning and practice.

WHAT WILL YOU IMPROVE?

- Memorizing new words and practicing them;
- Understanding the spoken language;
- Developing foreign pronunciation;;
- Improving your vocabulary.

Watch videos and practice listening  with pleasure! You will be able to improve your vocabulary, English pronunciation and practice spoken English by listening to native speakers!
Learning foreighn languages with SubTune is always fun and interesting! Join us and Learn English with us! 
